      "A large locker is standing there at the wall.\n",
    "southern wall":
      "A large locker is standing there at the wall.\n",
    "north wall":
      "A wooden door leads through the wall there. It is opened.\n",
    "northern wall":
      "A wooden door leads through the wall there. It is opened.\n",
