      "The door leads to the north. It is opened.\n",
    "wooden door":
      "The door leads to the north. It is opened.\n",
  ]);
}

string query_short() { return "Guardroom"; }

string query_long() {
  return
    "This is a small room. A table stands in the center of the room "
    "with some few chairs around it. Two crude beds are placed at the "
    "eastern wall. A wooden rack is standing at the western wall and "
    "a locker can be found next to the exit to the west. A wooden "
    "door leads to the north.\n";
}

string long() { return query_long(); }

string query_exit(string dir) {
  if (!exits || !dir)
    return 0;
  return exits[dir];
}

string query_exit_string() {
  return "The obvious exits are north and west.\n";
}

string query_item(string s) {
  if (!extras || !s)
    return 0;
  return extras[s];
}

int id(string str) {
  return str == "tower" || str == "here";
}
